  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"user-understands-which-tool-provides-which-validation","",用户阅读集成指南,文档 MUST 明确指出 schema 与 LSP 的职责边界
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"user-can-follow-the-guide-to-write-a-multiline-call-by-witho","","用户按文档将 `call_by` 改写为 block scalar 多行形式并在编辑器中触发 go-to-definition",该编辑器 MUST 仍能对 head reference 提供跳转（或给出可诊断的 warnings）
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"schema-mapping-is-configured-for-demand-yaml","",用户在 VSCode 打开一个被识别为 demand 的 YAML,扩展 MUST 确保该文件使用 demand schema
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"first-activation-provisions-and-starts-the-server","",用户首次在工作区启用该扩展,extension MUST 创建 venv 并安装 pinned 版本的 server 发行物
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"config-changes-update-schema-and-lsp-behavior",用户修改了 `scalim.yaml` 中与 discovery 相关的配置,扩展检测到配置变化,schema mapping 与 LSP 行为 MUST 按新配置更新
