  r9,"diagnostic-bundle-redacts-yaml-contents",workspace 中存在任意 YAML DSL 文件（含可能敏感内容）,"用户执行 `Scalim: Copy Diagnostic Bundle`",生成的文本 MUST 不包含 YAML 正文片段
  r10,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r10,"diagnostics-are-stable-for-all-included-fixtures",fixtures 根目录存在多份 demand/workflow YAML,运行 notebooks fixtures 回归套件,每个被纳入回归的 YAML MUST 产生 0 条 error diagnostics
  r11,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r11,"reference-resolution-degrades-gracefully","fixtures YAML 中存在一个 `call_by: \"pkg.mod:fn(arg=1)\"` 引用",回归套件对该引用执行 definition/hover/completion,测试 MUST 通过且进程不得崩溃
  r12,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
